- Cancellation of obsolete loading jobs
- Stable item IDs
- Incremental updates
- Efficient scrolling
- Memory-aware image loading

Do not load every full-resolution image into memory.

Do not repeatedly regenerate thumbnails during scrolling.

2.9 Missing Media and Unsupported Files

